  "instructions": [
    "Heat the vegetable shortening in a large dolsot-stone-bowl over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and sauté until translucent, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the chopped carrot, parsnip, and potato, and continue to sauté for another 10 minutes.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for 1 minute, until fragrant.",
    "Stir in the chopped cilantro and lemon juice.",
    "Transfer the bowl to the oven and bake at 400°F (200°C) for 20 minutes.",
    "Remove the bowl from the oven and top with sliced olives.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with additional cilantro if desired."
